window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I thought I knew danger after my first few weeks at MistHallow. I was wrong.</b></p> <p>The bonds between me and my guys have grown stronger, deeper, and more twisted. Our magick intertwines in ways that defy explanation.</p> <p>But our connection has unleashed something dark. Ancient. Hungry.</p> <p>Whispers of a forgotten ritual echo through the academy's halls. A ritual that could grant unimaginable power—or destroy us all.</p> <p>My wild magick is spiralling out of control, responding to their darkness in ways I never imagined. I'm losing myself in them, in the intoxicating blend of danger and desire they offer.</p> <p>But we're not the only ones after the ritual's power. Enemies lurk in the shadows, some wearing friendly faces. Trust becomes a luxury I can't afford.</p> <p>As the lines between love and obsession blur, I have to ask myself: am I strong enough to control the chaos we've unleashed? Or will I succumb to the darkness?</p> <p><i>This is a dark paranormal romance. It's book two of three in a reverse harem romance by </i>USA Today <i>bestselling author, Eve Newton. Set in England and written in British English. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
